@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### API liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### MongoDB readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Consistent unknown-route response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
